    <sys:String x:Key="History_Gecmis">History</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_BilgisayarinNeZamanVe">When and why the computer shut down, or the timer was cancelled, is shown here. Rows with a watch recording show events and screenshots when opened.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_GecmisiTemizle">Clear history</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_TumGecmisKayitlariniGozetim">Deletes all history entries, watch recordings and screenshots; you are asked first and it cannot be undone</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_GozetimKaydi">Watch recording</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_SizYokkenOlanlariKaydet">Record what happens while you are away</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_ZamanlayiciCalisirkenProgram">While the timer runs, it records whether the program hung or closed, the internet dropped, or Windows reported errors, and takes screenshots. You can review it here after the computer shuts down. Data stays only on this computer. Off by default; you are asked what will be recorded when you turn it on.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_GozetimKaydiniAcarYa">Turns watch recording on or off; applies from the next timer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_EkranGoruntusuAl">Take screenshots</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_BastaSorunAnlarindaAra">At the start, at problem moments, at intervals, and 5 seconds before the action. When off, only events are written.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_GoruntuAlani">Capture area</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_YalnizcaProgramIslerBitince">Program only: in &quot;When tasks finish&quot;, the watched program's window is captured and other windows stay hidden. If no program is chosen, the whole screen is captured.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_TumEkran">Whole screen</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_YalnizcaProgram">Program only</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_KucultulmusPrograminGoruntus">Capture the minimized program (experimental)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_ProgramHerGoruntudeEkran">For each capture, the program is briefly opened off-screen without taking focus and minimized again; the app waits about half a second. Programs that draw with the graphics card (e.g. Premiere) may produce a black image. When off, a minimized program is left alone and no image is taken.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_DeneyselKucultulmusProgramin">Experimental: briefly opens the minimized program's window off-screen to capture it</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_AraGoruntuSikligi">Interval screenshots</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_SorunOlmasaDaIsin">To see how the work is going even when nothing is wrong</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Kapali">Off</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_5DakikadaBir">Every 5 minutes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_15DakikadaBir">Every 15 minutes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_30DakikadaBir">Every 30 minutes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_60DakikadaBir">Every 60 minutes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_KayitKlasoru">Recording folder</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_KayitlarBuKlasordeSaklanir">Recordings are stored in this folder.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_KayitAdinaSiraNumarasi">Add a sequence number to the recording name</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_HerKaydinKlasorAdi">Each recording's folder name starts with a number (e.g. 0007_160657_02_11_2026); recordings stay in order.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_EkranGoruntusuneBilgiDamgasi">Info stamp on screenshots</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_GoruntununSagAltinaOkunakli">The time it was taken and the details you choose are printed in the bottom right of the image in readable text.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Tarih">Date</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_DamgayaGunAyYil">Writes day.month.year on the stamp</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Saat">Time</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_DamgayaSaatDakikaSaniye">Writes hour:minute:second on the stamp</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Mod">Mode</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_DamgayaZamanlayicininModuYaz">Writes the timer's mode on the stamp (e.g. Shut down after a duration)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_IzlenenProgram">Watched program</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_IslerBitinceDeProgram">If a program is chosen in &quot;When tasks finish&quot;, its name is written on the stamp</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_IstegeBagliNotOr">Optional note (e.g. computer name):</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_DamgayaEklenecekSerbestYazi">Free text added to the stamp; up to 60 characters</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Saklama">Retention</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_SinirlardanBiriAsilincaEn">When one of the limits is exceeded, the oldest recordings are deleted together with their screenshots.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_SaklananEnFazlaKayit">Maximum number of recordings kept</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Son10">Last 10</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Son30">Last 30</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="History_Son50">Last 50</sys:String>
