    <sys:String x:Key="Main_NeYapilsin">What should happen?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BilgisayariKapatir">Shuts the computer down</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Kapat">Shut down</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BilgisayariYenidenBaslatir">Restarts the computer</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_YenidenBaslat">Restart</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BilgisayariUyuturAcikIsler">Puts the computer to sleep; open work stays in memory</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Uyku">Sleep</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_HazirdaBeklet">Hibernate</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_NeZaman">When?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BelirlediginizSureDoluncaIsl">The action runs when the time you set is up</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SureSonra">After a duration</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SectiginizSaatteIslemYapilir">The action runs at the time you choose</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BelirliSaatte">At a set time</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SectiginizIslerBitinceIslem">The action runs when the tasks you choose finish</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslerBitince">When tasks finish</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Saat">hours</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_FareTekerlegiOkTuslari">Change with the mouse wheel, arrow keys or by typing</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Dakika">minutes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemBugunSectiginizSaatte">The action runs today at the time you choose</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Bugun">Today</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemYarinSectiginizSaatte">The action runs tomorrow at the time you choose</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Yarin">Tomorrow</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_EnErkenSaatAyarlar">The earliest time follows the shortest duration in Settings &gt; Security. If you move the hour past 23, the choice switches to Tomorrow.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SectiginizIslerBittigindeIsl">The action runs when the tasks you choose finish. You can measure each task for the whole system or for a single program.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Programlar">Programs</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_AcikProgramListesiniYenile">Refresh the list of open programs</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_VeriAktarimiBelirlenenHizin">This task counts as finished when data transfer drops below the set speed</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IndirmeYukleme">Download / upload</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_HangiYondekiVeriAktariminin">Which direction of data transfer to wait for</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IndirmeVeYukleme">Download and upload</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_YalnizcaIndirme">Download only</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_YalnizcaYukleme">Upload only</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Hiz">Speed</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_HizBuDegerinAltinda">If the speed stays below this value, the transfer counts as finished. You can pick it by watching the live value at the top right.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_KbSnAltinaDusunce">Finished when below KB/s</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Olculecek">Measured</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BirProgramSecersenizYalnizca">If you pick a program, only that program's data transfer (network + disk) is measured. For example, a Chrome download or a Google Drive upload.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemciKullanimiBelirlenenOr">This task counts as finished when processor usage drops below the set level</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemciRenderDisaAktarma">Processor (render, export)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_Kullanim">Usage</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemciKullanimiBuOranin">The task counts as finished if processor usage stays below this level</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_AltinaDusunce">% when below</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BirProgramSecersenizYalnizca2">If you pick a program, only that program's processor usage is measured. For example, Premiere or DaVinci Resolve.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_DosyaKopyalamaTasimaYa">This task counts as finished when file copy, move or backup speed drops below the set value</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_DosyaAktarimiKopyalamaYedekl">File transfer (copy, backup)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_AktarimHiziBuDegerin">The task counts as finished if the transfer speed stays below this value</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_MbSnAltinaDusunce">When below MB/s</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_OtomatikAktarimBaslayincaHiz">Automatic: once a transfer starts, drives whose speed exceeds the threshold (source and destination) are watched and writes on other drives are ignored. Completion is judged by the median of the last 20 seconds, so short bursts of writes do not delay it. For internet traffic use the Download / upload condition. The list is updated with the refresh button.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_EkranKartiKullanimiBelirlene">This task counts as finished when graphics card usage drops below the set level</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_EkranKartiGpuRender">Graphics card (GPU render)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_EkranKartiKullanimiBu">The task counts as finished if graphics card usage stays below this level</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BirProgramSecersenizYalnizca3">If you pick a program, only that program's graphics card usage is measured.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SectiginizPrograminTumPencer">This task counts as finished when all windows and processes of the program you choose have closed</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_BirProgramTamamenKapaninca">When a program closes completely</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_KapanmasiBeklenecekProgramLi">The program to wait for. If it is not in the list, open it and press the refresh button.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_ListeyiYenile">Refresh list</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_NeZamanBitmisSayilsin">When should it count as finished?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SecilenIsler">Selected tasks</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_KisaDuraklamalarYanlisliklaB">Tasks must stay calm for this long so that short pauses are not mistaken for completion</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_DkSakinKalirsaBitmis">min calm counts as finished</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_RenderArasiYaDa">Prevents early shutdown during short pauses, such as between renders or while waiting for a download. When off, the task counts as finished as soon as the values fall below the threshold (with a 30 s safety margin).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_KapaliykenDegerlerEsiginAlti">When off, the task counts as finished as soon as the values fall below the threshold (with a 30 s safety margin)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_OnceIslerinBasladiginiGor">First see the tasks start</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SecilenIslerBirKez">The counter does not start until the selected tasks have started running once. You can set the timer before starting the work; an idle computer does not shut down right away.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SecilenIslerBirKez2">The counter does not advance until the selected tasks have started once</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslerBittiktenSonra">After tasks finish</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslerBitinceIslemdenOnce">When tasks finish, a countdown of this many minutes runs before the action; you can cancel during it</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_DkDahaBekle">min more</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslemdenOnceTaninanEk">Extra time given before the action; if you return to the computer you can cancel during it. If a task restarts meanwhile, the wait stops and is counted again when the task finishes. When off, a final warning of at least 1 minute is shown as soon as the tasks finish.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_KapaliykenIslerBiterBitmez">When off, a 1-minute final warning countdown starts as soon as the tasks finish</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslerBitmeseBileEn">Even if tasks do not finish, at the latest</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_TakiliKalanBirIs">So the computer does not stay on forever because of a stuck task, the action runs after at most this many hours</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_SaatSonraUygula">hours later, apply</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_TakiliKalanBirEsitleme">A stuck sync or background traffic cannot keep the computer on until morning.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Main_IslerBitmeseBileBelirlenen">The action runs at the end of the set time even if the tasks have not finished</sys:String>
